    {
     "title": "Central tendency and dispersion",
     "takeaway": "Mean, median and mode tell you where the data sits, and range, IQR, variance and SD tell you how spread out it is. With outliers, prefer median and IQR.",
     "path": "notes/data-science/statistics/descriptive/central-tendency-and-dispersion.md",
     "day": "2026-11-07",
     "kind": "note",
     "status": "done",
