     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Percentiles, the five-number summary and outlier detection",
     "takeaway": "To flag outliers, use IQR fences (Q1 − 1.5·IQR, Q3 + 1.5·IQR) on skewed data and |z| > 3 on normal data, so check the shape of the distribution before picking a method.",
     "path": "notes/data-science/statistics/descriptive/percentiles-and-outliers.md",
     "day": "2026-11-07",
     "kind": "note",
     "status": "done",
     "source": "Data_Science.pdf (pp. 48, 54–55)",
